# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# plate.sm -- A plate with inserts of a table of its own and of the library
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# Two types of the table next to it, a nut and a stud in a blind hole,
# and inch types of the library: a nut named apart from its hole, a
# flush nut, a flush-head stud, standoffs through and blind, a
# stainless nut, a concealed-head stud in a blind hole and a nut of the
# longest shank.
sheet 2.5 1 0.44
plate p 0 0 120 60 at 0 0 0 axes +x +y
insert a nut-local near 10 10 along z
insert b chc-local near 30 10 along z
insert c s-632-1 far as nut_c 50 10 along z
insert d f-632-2 near 70 10 along z
insert e fhs-632-4 far 90 10 along z
insert f so-440-8 near 110 10 along z
insert g bso-440-10 near 10 40 along z
insert h cls-440-1 far 30 40 along z
insert i chc-632-4 near 50 40 along z
insert j s-632-3 far 70 40 along z
